%[text] # Cycling part 2
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"}
%[text] 
%%
%[text] ### Setup Python environment
%[text] **prompt**
%[text] how to get pip
!curl https://bootstrap.pypa.io/get-pip.py -o /tmp/get-pip.py %[output:710124b1]
!python /tmp/get-pip.py %[output:1c0a3034]
!python -m pip --version %[output:216a5ab1]
%%
!python -m pip install garmin-fit-sdk pandas %[output:631c56de]
%%
